  "description": "Package updates are available for Amazon Linux 2 that fix the following vulnerabilities:\nCVE-2026-119842:\n\tA flaw was found in GStreamer's gst-plugins-base MicroDVD subtitle parser. When processing a specially crafted subtitle file, the parser may dereference a NULL pointer, causing the application to crash when a user opens or plays media with a malformed MicroDVD (.sub) subtitle file.\n",
